{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261030%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 0930　34庭　法官郭啟安<br/>28歲男子被控謀殺女瑜伽導師｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　5庭　暫委裁判官陳雨舟<br/>雙程證女涉7年前訛稱來港探配偶及對方為當時待產嬰親父｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官鄭念慈<br/>涉騙「百分百擔保」600萬元貸款　中科監察主席潘焯鴻與妻子被控5罪<br/>｜轉介文件</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 1430　6庭　暫委裁判官吳思思<br/>Channel C涉欠薪逾16萬元　管理層被控5罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 1430　1庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>涉發布代母廣告、商議安排並收款　兩人及公司被控違《人類生殖科技條例》｜審前覆核<br/>► 1130　2庭　裁判官林子康<br/>印傭涉服墮胎藥致胎兒死亡　被控殺胎罪｜提訊日</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:48.543097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":442,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T10:13:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:19:46.243714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.772907+00:00","content_hash":"c6a984af714bcc4c9e94122d7af440ce18ea7c2511b58b1ce39c5c86a5bf3bac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}